inting-begin.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>共产主义时代的档案揭露了使匈牙利留在苏联轨道上的庞大线人网络。但它们有多可靠呢？由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:11:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/world/europe/hungary-threw-open-its-secret-police-files-let-the-finger-pointing-begin.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>所罗门群岛与澳大利亚签署安全条约，对中国构成打击</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/world/asia/solomon-islands-security-treaty-australia-china.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>2022 年所罗门群岛与中国签署的协议引发了人们的担忧，该协议将使北京能够在这个太平洋岛屿上建立军事存在。新协议排除了此类基地。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:56:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/world/asia/solomon-islands-security-treaty-australia-china.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>特朗普政府暂停与厄瓜多尔的联合行动</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/world/americas/ecuador-us-military-operations-trump.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>政府已停止军事行动，同时调查厄瓜多尔军队杀害一名被指控的帮派头目的行动。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:41:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/world/americas/ecuador-us-military-operations-trump.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>创始人为 ICE 工作的拉丁裔咖啡馆关闭</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/tasa-coffee-chicago-closed-ice-owner.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>芝加哥的塔萨咖啡烘焙店在工人罢工抗议后永久关门。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 19:26:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/tasa-coffee-chicago-closed-ice-owner.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>爱荷华州即将发生爆炸。居民对此无能为力。</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/us/iowa-ammunition-plant-lead-explosion-middletown.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>米德尔敦毗邻一处陆军设施，周三将在那里引爆危险化学品，居民们正在用胶带封住门，准备逃离。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDat