2026/11/24/us/politics/abrego-garcia-leave-deportation.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>挪威关闭了最后一个煤矿，结束了北极的生活方式</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/world/europe/norway-svalbard-arctic-last-coal-mine.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>斯瓦尔巴群岛的采矿历史可以追溯到一个多世纪前。但这个冰冷的群岛现在是游轮目的地和地缘政治热点。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:56:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/world/europe/norway-svalbard-arctic-last-coal-mine.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>在混乱的世界中务实的代价</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/dealbook/world-chaos-pragmatism.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>在 DealBook 成立 25 周年的峰会上，商界领袖探讨了动荡时期不信任的危险。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:41:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/dealbook/world-chaos-pragmatism.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item><item><title>为那些试图在人工智能世界取得成功的人寻求帮助</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/dealbook/work-jobs-task-force.html?nlt=related_link_compact</link><description>虽然年轻人在劳动力市场面临严峻挑战，但有一些方法可以提高找到好工作的机会。由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:26:06 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/24/business/dealbook/work-jobs-task-force.html?nlt=related_link_compact</guid></item></channel></rss>